--Description: 
--We need one consolidated table that shows, for every U.S. state, 2022 production totals for:  
--   • Corn (FIELD CROPS) in bushels (BU)  
--   • Mushrooms (HORTICULTURE) – the data are actually stored in pounds (LB).  
--Steps inside this single query:  
--  1) “corn” CTE: pull STATE–level rows for corn, statistic = PRODUCTION, unit = BU.  
--  2) “mush” CTE: pull STATE–level rows for mushrooms, statistic = PRODUCTION, unit = LB.  
--     (the pounds are left as-is because mushrooms are not reported in bushels).  
--  3) FULL OUTER JOIN the two CTEs to list any state that has either crop;  
--     COALESCE merges the state code coming from whichever side is present.  
--  4) Result is ordered alphabetically by state.  
--You can later decide whether to convert mushroom pounds to some bushel equivalent.  

